@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<style>
    .content h3 {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .content p {
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    p a {
        color: #ff344f !important;
    }
</style>
<section class="terms-conditions-area pb-90 pt-120">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-10">
                <div class="terms-conditions-wrapper data-content-box wow fadeInLeft">
                    <div class="section-title text-center mb-60 wow fadeInUp">
                        <h2><span class="line">Privacy Policy</span></h2>
                        <p class="f-23" style="line-height:32px">
                            Policies of Catpedigreeworld.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="terms-content content">
                        <h3 class="title">1. Access to data by Catpedigreeworld and the Business User:</h3>
                       
                        <p class="f-18">
                            <ul class="f-18">
                                <li class="my-2">1.1. During the term of the agreement with the Business User, and for a period thereafter, Catpedigreeworld has access to information and data of Business Users provided by them when using the Website or that are generated, or used in execution of the license for content contained in these Terms of Use, in the context of its services. This includes information that Business Users provide to Catpedigreeworld when they register, such as personal data, various information necessary for the creation of an account, message content, and content. Also, during the use of the Website, information is generated by Catpedigreeworld, such as information about Advertisements placed, settings for the display of Advertisements, Experiences, user activity, payment information (if applicable) and communication between Users.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">1.2. Additional services, such as messages, contact information of (potential) buyers and relevant information about his Advertisement(s). A Business User will have access to his account and associated information, such as Advertising Content and Information and communications with other Users, during the term of their agreement with Catpedigreeworld.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">1.3. If Catpedigreeworld provides provided or generated data to third parties and this is not necessary for the provision of services, information about this will be provided to the Business User, to the extent required by law.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">1.4. After the termination of the agreement with the Business User, Catpedigreeworld may retain information and data from the Business User's account to the extent permitted by law.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">2. Sharing personal data with third parties</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            Catpedigreeworld does not sell your data to third parties and will only provide it if this is necessary for
                            the execution of our agreement with you or to comply with a legal obligation. We enter into a processing
                            agreement with companies that process your data on our behalf to ensure the same level of security and
                            confidentiality of your data. Catpedigreeworld remains responsible for this processing.
                        </p>
                        
                        <h3 class="title">3. Social Media</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            If you use social media, such as Facebook, and you indicate that you like an advertisement, this
                            advertisement will appear on your social media account. This does not give us access to your social
                            media account, but you can share ads that you like or find interesting with your friends. If you ask us a
                            question via Social Media, we will save that message and your account name so that we can respond to
                            your message.
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">4. Cookies, or similar techniques, that we use:</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            We do not tolerate the misuse of Catpedigreeworld. You are not permitted to add Catpedigreeworld
                            advertisers to your mailing list (email or post). If you, as an advertiser, notice that someone is abusing
                            Catpedigreeworld (spam or spoof e-mails), please send an e-mail to <a href="mailto:" info@catpedigreeworld.com">info@catpedigreeworld.com</a>.
                        </p>
                        
                        <h3 class="title">4. Cookies, or similar techniques, that we use:</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            Catpedigreeworld only uses technical and functional cookies. And analytical cookies that do not infringe
                            on your privacy. A cookie is a small text file that is stored on your computer, tablet or smartphone when
                            you first visit this website. The cookies we use are necessary for the technical operation of the website
                            and your ease of use. They ensure that the website works properly and remember, for example, your
                            preferred settings. It also allows us to optimize our website. You can opt-out of cookies by setting your
                            internet browser to stop storing cookies. In addition, you can also delete all information that has been
                            previously stored through your browser's settings.
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">5. Viewing, modifying or deleting data:</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            You have the right to access, correct or delete your personal data. In addition, you have the right to
                            withdraw your consent to the data processing or to object to the processing of your personal data by
                            Catpedigreeworld and you have the right to data portability. This means that you can submit a request to
                            us to send the personal data we have about you in a computer file to you or another organisation named
                            by you.
                        </p>
                         <p class="f-18">
                            You can send a request for inspection, correction, deletion, data transfer of your personal data or
                            request for withdrawal of your consent or objection to the processing of your personal data to
                            <a href="mailto:" info@catpedigreeworld.com">info@catpedigreeworld.com</a>
                        </p>
                         <p class="f-18">
                            To ensure that the request for access has been made by you, we ask you to send a copy of your proof of
                            identity with the request. In this copy, black out your passport photo, MRZ (machine readable zone, the
                            strip with numbers at the bottom of the passport), passport number and Citizen Service Number (BSN).
                            This is to protect your privacy.
                        </p>
                         <p class="f-18">
                            We will respond to your request as soon as possible, but within four weeks.
                            Catpedigreeworld would also like to point out that you have the possibility to file a complaint with the
                            national supervisory authority, the Dutch Data Protection Authority. You can do so via the following link:
                            <a href="https://autoriteitpersoonsgegevens.nl/nl/contact-met-de-autoriteit-persoonsgegevens/tip-ons">https://autoriteitpersoonsgegevens.nl/nl/contact-met-de-autoriteit-persoonsgegevens/tip-ons</a>
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">6. Safety:</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            All data that you leave with us is safely locked away with the most modern techniques. If you have
                            nothing to do with your data, you can't access it. If we transfer your data to another party (e.g. the CRM
                            System and accounting program), we demand that the other party handles your data with the same care
                            as we do and that it is only used for the purpose for which he/she received it. If you feel that your data is
                            not properly secured or there are indications of misuse, please let us know immediately via 
                            <a href="mailto:" info@catpedigreeworld.com">info@catpedigreeworld.com</a>
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">7. Measures to Protect Your Personal Data:</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            Catpedigreeworld has taken the following measures to protect your personal data:
                            <ul class="f-18">
                                <li class="my-2">7.1. Security software in the website and on the server, such as a virus scanner and firewall.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">7.2. TLS (formerly SSL) ensures that we send your data via a secure internet connection. You can see this by the address bar 'https' and the lock in your address bar.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">7.3. DKIM, SPF, and DMARC are three internet standards that we use to prevent you from receiving emails on our behalf that contain viruses, are spam, or are intended to obtain personal (login) data.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">7.4. DNSSEC is an additional security measure for resolving a domain name to the associated IP address; it is provided with a digital signature. You can have that signature checked automatically, preventing redirection to a fake IP address.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">8. Fraud</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            You don't assume it, but unfortunately it can happen: Fraud. If necessary, we use customer data to
                            investigate, prevent and combat fraud. If necessary, we provide customer data to the government or the
                            relevant breed club.
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">9. Misuse and Unsolicited Commercial Communications ("spam")</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            We do not tolerate the misuse of Catpedigreeworld. You are not permitted to add Catpedigreeworld
                            advertisers to your mailing list (email or post). If you, as an advertiser, notice that someone is abusing
                            Catpedigreeworld (spam or spoof e-mails), please send an e-mail to <a href="mailto:info@catpedigreeworld.com">info@catpedigreeworld.com</a>.
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">10. Personal Data That We Process About You</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            You can visit Catpedigreeworld without having to sign up by registering an account. When you decide to
                            provide us with your personal data, you consent to this data being transmitted to, and stored on, our
                            server. "Personal data" is information that can be linked to a specific person and can be used to identify a
                            specific person.
                            Catpedigreeworld processes your personal data because you make use of our services (placing an
                            advertisement) and/or because you provide this data to us yourself (registering a Cattery Link or
                            registering as a Member at Catpedigreeworld).
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">11. What is Personal Data?</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            Personal data is information relating to an identified or identifiable natural person. An identifiable
                            natural person is one who can be identified, directly or indirectly, by reference to an identifier such as a
                            name, an identification number, location data, an online identifier or to one or more factors specific to
                            the physical, physiological, genetic, mental, economic, cultural or social identity of that natural person.
                            We do not consider data that has been anonymised or aggregated so that it can no longer be used to
                            identify a specific natural person, whether in combination with other information or otherwise, as
                            personal data.
                            We collect personal data from you when you use our Services.
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">12. What Information and Personal Data Do We Collect from You:</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            We collect the following personal data from you:
                            <ul class="f-18">
                                <li class="my-2">12.1. Cattery name.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.2. The breed club you are affiliated with.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.3. First and last name.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.4. Gender.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.5. Address.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.6. Telephone number.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.7. Email address.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.8. IP address.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.9. Other personal data that you actively provide, for example by creating a profile on this website, in correspondence and by telephone.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.10. Location data.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.11. Information about your activities on our website.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.12. Data about your browsing behaviour across different websites (for example, because this company is part of an advertising network).</li>
                                <li class="my-2">12.13. Internet browser and device type.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </p>



                        <h3 class="title">13. What We Don't Process</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            Catpedigreeworld does not process special and/or sensitive personal data.
                            Our website and/or service does not intend to collect data about website visitors who are younger than
                            16 years old, unless they have permission from parents or guardians. However, we cannot verify that a
                            visitor is over the age of 16. We encourage parents to be involved in their children's online activities in
                            order to prevent the collection of information about children without parental consent. If you believe
                            that we have collected personal information about a minor without this consent, please contact us at
                            <a href="mailto:info@catpedigreeworld.com">info@catpedigreeworld.com</a> and we will delete this information.
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">14. What Do We Do with Your Data?</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            We use your data for a variety of purposes. Below you can see what those goals are. We use the data we
                            receive from you, as well as the data we collect. For example, data about your visit to our website or
                            previous advertisements that you have placed.
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">15. Catpedigreeworld Processes Your Personal Data for the Following Purposes:</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            <ul class="f-18">
                                <li class="my-2">15.1. <strong>Post Your Ad:</strong> In addition, we also offer you the possibility to create an account profile. In your account profile, we store the following information, among other things: Your (Cattery) name, address, telephone number, e-mail address. This is useful, because then you don't have to re-enter this information every time. We do not store any information about your previous ad placements in the account profile.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">15.2. <strong>Post a Link to Your Cattery:</strong> To place a link to your Cattery, we need your Cattery name, e-mail address, and place of residence. Without this data, a link listing would be very brief and would not offer any added value compared to the Google Search Engine. To add a link to your Cattery, you need to create an account.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">15.3. <strong>Contact You:</strong> It is possible that we have questions about your advertisement, we will then contact you with the information you have entered. In addition, we want to be able to inform you about changes to our services and products.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">15.4. <strong>Contact Us:</strong> You can call and email us. In order to be able to help you quickly with your questions, we use your data and make notes that we keep in our file. We will respond to your request as soon as possible, but within four weeks.</li>
                                <li class="my-2">15.5. <strong>Accounting:</strong> In order to comply with the National Taxes Act, we also keep accounts and time registration. We also store a number of personal data for this purpose: your name, address, and e-mail address.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">16. How Long Do We Keep Your Personal Data?</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            <ul class="f-18">
                                <li class="my-2">16.1. <strong>Retention Periods:</strong> In any case, Catpedigreeworld does not store your personal data any longer than is strictly necessary to achieve the purposes for which your data is collected. We use the following retention periods for the following (categories of) personal data:</li>
                                <ul class="f-18">
                                    <li class="my-2"><strong>First and last name:</strong> 7 years, Law on State Taxes.</li>
                                    <li class="my-2"><strong>Address:</strong> 7 years, Law on State Taxes.</li>
                                    <li class="my-2"><strong>Cattery data:</strong> Up to 3 years after last contact or activity on the website.</li>
                                </ul>
                                <li class="my-2">16.2. <strong>Automated Decision-Making:</strong> Catpedigreeworld does not make decisions on the basis of automated processing on matters that may have (significant) consequences for individuals. These are decisions that are made by computer programs or systems, without the involvement of a human being (e.g., an employee of Catpedigreeworld).</li>
                                <li class="my-2">16.3. <strong>Improvement of the Website and Service:</strong> We are constantly working to improve our website and service. That is why we may use your data in the future to ask you if you would like to participate in a no-obligation customer survey. Sometimes others do that research for us. We will provide them with your e-mail address. Of course, the other person must also comply with our privacy rules. For example, your e-mail address must be deleted at the end of the study. Catpedigreeworld analyzes your behavior on our website in order to improve the website and tailor the range of products and services to your preferences.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">17. Privacy and Security</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            Catpedigreeworld is responsible for the processing of your personal data as set out in this privacy statement.
                        </p>

                        <h3 class="title">18. Our Personal Data</h3>
                        <p class="f-18">
                            <strong>Website:</strong> www.catpedigreeworld.com<br>
                            My name is P.J.K. Verhoeven and O. Dursun and we are the founders of Catpedigreeworld. We can be
                            reached by mail <a href="mailto:info@catpedigreeworld.com">info@catpedigreeworld.com</a>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
